      "date": "2026-05-31T05:59:18.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.39 (vs ₹0.44 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.39 (down from ₹0.44 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹41.3m (down 56% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹5.29m (down 13% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 13% (up from 6.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 57% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 23% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
