      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: Revenue: ₹13.4m (up 95% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹3.03m (up 459% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 23% (up from 7.9% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 45% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 16% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
